docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-24-deslopify-jungle-design.md-119-- Seven leaf variants `PlaneGeometry(.34,1.25,2,8)`; instanced max plants `1800`, canopy `200`.
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-24-deslopify-jungle-design.md-120-- Tier-visible plants/canopy: low `320/40`, medium `900/110`, high `1400/200`.
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-24-deslopify-jungle-design.md-121-- Greens `0x3f7a34`, `0x4f8a3a`, `0x2f6a36`, `0x5d8f3c`, `0x356f45`.
