docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-24-deslopify-jungle-design.md-150-- Card canvas `640×600`; outer slop `#9a3f8d` / original `#e0a13c`; inner `#f4f2ee`; thumbnail `(24,24,592,333)`, radius `12`.
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-24-deslopify-jungle-design.md-151-- Thumbnail word Barlow `86px` if length `>8`, otherwise `140px`; sub IBM Mono `30px`; slop thumbnail `50px Arial`; badge `24px system`; duration `24px Mono`; avatar radius `30`; title `38px Barlow`, max width `500`, line height `44`; metadata `26px`; badge `22px`.
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-24-deslopify-jungle-design.md-152-- Wipe uniform `uWipe`; `e=uWipe*1.08-.04`; seam `exp(-abs(e)*70)`; seam colour `vec3(1,.6,.22)*4`.
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-24-deslopify-jungle-design.md-153-- Tag canvas `512×240`; plane `.9×.42`; outer slop `#9a3f8d` / original `#e0a13c`; inner `#efe8ee` / `#5a3d27`; IBM Mono `24px`; Barlow Semi Condensed `50px`; wrap `440`; line height `56`.
