docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-24-deslopify-jungle-design.md-155-- Labels: use `ctx.font='700 120px "Barlow Semi Condensed"'`; measured width plus padding, ceil, next power of two; no max width; plane width `HEIGHT*w/CANVAS_H`; await `document.fonts.load` with test fallback.
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-24-deslopify-jungle-design.md-156-- Plank title `Commits im Lebensverlauf`; subtitle `Commits over the project's life`; title `40px`; subtitle `20px`.
