@@ -0,0 +1,11 @@
+# Changelog
+
+All notable changes to this project are documented here.
+
+## [2026-09-24]
+
+### Added
+
+- **CODEX:** Added jungle stele terminal skin with compact canvas layout, page dots, controls, tilt, moss edging, and project plank label.
+- **CODEX:** Added jungle liana seed lever with branch presentation, pull sway, reduced-motion snap, and reseed behavior.
+- **CODEX:** Wired jungle project scenes to use terminal and liana skins while preserving default skins elsewhere.
